[[2047,31,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3238799\">7040A37</a></p><p>1. Disconnect electrical connections (1a), (1b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1a</p></td><td><p>Alarm switch</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236210\">H70A</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Alarm switch</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236211\">H70B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Undo the nut.</p><p>3. Remove the switch and bridge.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018931.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,31,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the switch is undamaged.</p><p>Position the switch and bridge.</p><p>Tighten the nut.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection.</p><p><a href=\"#/3238799\">7040A37</a></p>"]]